{"id":"6fbf6d07e06166e9","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/869_Cyclic_Linear_Logic.md","title":"869 Cyclic Linear Logic","display":"869_Cyclic_Linear_Logic","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"869-Cyclic-Linear-Logic\">869 Cyclic Linear Logic</h1>\n<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}\\)</span> 为原子集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}^{\\perp}=\\{p^\\perp:p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}^{\\perp}=\\{p^\\perp:p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\}\\)</span> 为与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}\\)</span> 不交的副本，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Lit}=\\mathsf{At}\\cup\\mathsf{At}^{\\perp}\">\\(\\mathsf{Lit}=\\mathsf{At}\\cup\\mathsf{At}^{\\perp}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\partial(p)=p^\\perp,\\partial(p^\\perp)=p\">\\(\\partial(p)=p^\\perp,\\partial(p^\\perp)=p\\)</span>。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{ten},\\operatorname{par}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{ten},\\operatorname{par}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第 2 节定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 为这些构造子生成的最小闭包。其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{Lit}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{Lit}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ten},\\operatorname{par}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ten},\\operatorname{par}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Cyclic Linear Logic 在后文将上下文设为循环列表，只允许旋转等同而不允许任意交换。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式与结构操作\">2. 公式与结构操作</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 是最小集合，满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\mathsf{Lit}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a\\in\\mathsf{Lit}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(a)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{one}\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{one}\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ten}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{ten}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{par}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{par}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(a)^\\perp=\\operatorname{atm}(\\partial(a)),\\quad\n\\operatorname{one}^\\perp=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}^\\perp=\\operatorname{one},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}(a)^\\perp=\\operatorname{atm}(\\partial(a)),\\quad\n\\operatorname{one}^\\perp=\\operatorname{bot},\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}^\\perp=\\operatorname{one},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ten}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{par}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp),\\quad\n\\operatorname{par}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{ten}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ten}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{par}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp),\\quad\n\\operatorname{par}(A,B)^\\perp=\\operatorname{ten}(A^\\perp,B^\\perp).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>与替换：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(a))=\\{\\operatorname{base}(a)\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{one})=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(a))=\\{\\operatorname{base}(a)\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{one})=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{bot})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ten}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{par}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{ten}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{par}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{base}(p)=p,\\operatorname{base}(p^\\perp)=p\">\\(\\operatorname{base}(p)=p,\\operatorname{base}(p^\\perp)=p\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[\\sigma]\">\\(A[\\sigma]\\)</span>，且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(a)[\\sigma]=\\widehat\\sigma(a),\\quad\n\\operatorname{one}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{one},\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{bot},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}(a)[\\sigma]=\\widehat\\sigma(a),\\quad\n\\operatorname{one}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{one},\\quad\n\\operatorname{bot}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{bot},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ten}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ten}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\quad\n\\operatorname{par}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{par}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ten}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{ten}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\quad\n\\operatorname{par}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{par}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(p)=\\sigma(p),\\widehat\\sigma(p^\\perp)=\\sigma(p)^\\perp\">\\(\\widehat\\sigma(p)=\\sigma(p),\\widehat\\sigma(p^\\perp)=\\sigma(p)^\\perp\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{X\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:X\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。定义绑定原子函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>固定新鲜原子选择函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(X)\\notin X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由于没有绑定名，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{CycLL}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{CycLL}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"3.-循环上下文\">3. 循环上下文</h1>\n<p>定义有限有序列表及空列：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{List}=\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Frm}^m,\\qquad\\epsilon=().\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{List}=\\bigcup_{m\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Frm}^m,\\qquad\\epsilon=().\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma:m\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\Gamma:m\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta:n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\Delta:n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span>，连接 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\cdot\\Delta:m+n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\">\\(\\Gamma\\cdot\\Delta:m+n\\to\\mathsf{Frm}\\)</span> 定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\Gamma\\cdot\\Delta)(i)=\\begin{cases}\\Gamma(i)&amp;i&lt;m,\\\\\\Delta(i-m)&amp;m\\le i&lt;m+n.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\Gamma\\cdot\\Delta)(i)=\\begin{cases}\\Gamma(i)&amp;i&lt;m,\\\\\\Delta(i-m)&amp;m\\le i&lt;m+n.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>列表相等为长度相同且对应项相等，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A)\">\\((A)\\)</span> 是长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 的列表。逗号表示同一次序的列表连接。\n定义旋转关系</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\sim_{\\mathsf{rot}}\\Delta\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists \\Pi,\\Theta\\in\\mathsf{List}\\,(\\Gamma=\\Pi\\cdot\\Theta\\land\\Delta=\\Theta\\cdot\\Pi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\sim_{\\mathsf{rot}}\\Delta\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists \\Pi,\\Theta\\in\\mathsf{List}\\,(\\Gamma=\\Pi\\cdot\\Theta\\land\\Delta=\\Theta\\cdot\\Pi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sim_{\\mathsf{rot}}\">\\(\\sim_{\\mathsf{rot}}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{List}\">\\(\\mathsf{List}\\)</span> 上的等价关系。循环上下文集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CycCtx}=\\mathsf{List}/{\\sim_{\\mathsf{rot}}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{CycCtx}=\\mathsf{List}/{\\sim_{\\mathsf{rot}}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\Gamma],[\\Delta]\\in\\mathsf{CycCtx}\">\\([\\Gamma],[\\Delta]\\in\\mathsf{CycCtx}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"[\\Gamma]\\oplus[\\Delta]=\\{[\\Gamma&#39;\\cdot\\Delta&#39;]:\\Gamma&#39;\\sim_{\\mathsf{rot}}\\Gamma,\\Delta&#39;\\sim_{\\mathsf{rot}}\\Delta\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[[\\Gamma]\\oplus[\\Delta]=\\{[\\Gamma&#39;\\cdot\\Delta&#39;]:\\Gamma&#39;\\sim_{\\mathsf{rot}}\\Gamma,\\Delta&#39;\\sim_{\\mathsf{rot}}\\Delta\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\oplus:\\mathsf{CycCtx}\\times\\mathsf{CycCtx}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{CycCtx})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\oplus:\\mathsf{CycCtx}\\times\\mathsf{CycCtx}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{CycCtx})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>是一个代表元无关的有限值关系；这里保留所有可能的循环拼接类，而不任意选择代表元。\n序列集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}=\\{\\vdash C:C\\in\\mathsf{CycCtx}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}=\\{\\vdash C:C\\in\\mathsf{CycCtx}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>相继式相等只按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{CycCtx}\">\\(\\mathsf{CycCtx}\\)</span> 的等价类相等判断；没有额外交换、弱化或收缩同余。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理\">4. 公理</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}=\\{\\vdash[A,A^\\perp]:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\\cup\\{\\vdash[\\operatorname{one}]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}=\\{\\vdash[A,A^\\perp]:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}\\cup\\{\\vdash[\\operatorname{one}]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-规则关系\">5. 规则关系</h1>\n<p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Seq}^n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\n=\n\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathsf{Seq}^n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以下每个规则族均是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}\">\\(\\mathsf{Seq}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}\\)</span> 的子集。</p>\n<p>约定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1};Q):=((Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1}),Q)\">\\((Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1};Q):=((Q_0,\\ldots,Q_{n-1}),Q)\\)</span>，并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(();Q):=((),Q)\">\\((();Q):=((),Q)\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes}=\n\\{((\\vdash C),(\\vdash D);\\vdash E):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{CycCtx},\\ \\exists\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List}\\;\\exists A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\;(C=[\\Gamma,A]\\land D=[\\Delta,B]\\land E\\in[\\Gamma]\\oplus[\\Delta,\\operatorname{ten}(A,B)])\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes}=\n\\{((\\vdash C),(\\vdash D);\\vdash E):C,D,E\\in\\mathsf{CycCtx},\\ \\exists\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List}\\;\\exists A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\;(C=[\\Gamma,A]\\land D=[\\Delta,B]\\land E\\in[\\Gamma]\\oplus[\\Delta,\\operatorname{ten}(A,B)])\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\parr}=\\{((\\vdash[\\Gamma,A,B]);\\vdash[\\Gamma,\\operatorname{par}(A,B)]):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\parr}=\\{((\\vdash[\\Gamma,A,B]);\\vdash[\\Gamma,\\operatorname{par}(A,B)]):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}=\\{((\\vdash[\\Gamma]);\\vdash[\\Gamma,\\operatorname{bot}]):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}=\\{((\\vdash[\\Gamma]);\\vdash[\\Gamma,\\operatorname{bot}]):\\Gamma\\in\\mathsf{List}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{rot}}=\\{((\\vdash[\\Gamma]);\\vdash[\\Delta]):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},\\Gamma\\sim_{\\mathsf{rot}}\\Delta\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{rot}}=\\{((\\vdash[\\Gamma]);\\vdash[\\Delta]):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},\\Gamma\\sim_{\\mathsf{rot}}\\Delta\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}=\\{((\\vdash[\\Gamma,A]),(\\vdash[\\Delta,A^\\perp]);\\vdash[\\Gamma\\cdot\\Delta]):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}=\\{((\\vdash[\\Gamma,A]),(\\vdash[\\Delta,A^\\perp]);\\vdash[\\Gamma\\cdot\\Delta]):\\Gamma,\\Delta\\in\\mathsf{List},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\parr}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{rot}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}\n=\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\parr}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\bot}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{rot}}\\cup\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明树\">6. 证明树</h1>\n<p>有限有根有序树是四元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\">\\((T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\)</span>：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 有限非空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in T\">\\(r\\in T\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 无父节点，其余节点有唯一父节点；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\prec\">\\(\\prec\\)</span> 无环且每个节点沿父关系有限步到达 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}(u)\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}(u)\\)</span> 无重复地有限列举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的全部直接子节点。</p>\n<p>明确关系及枚举的型别和方向：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\prec\\ \\subseteq T\\times T,\\qquad\\operatorname{ch}:T\\to T^{&lt;\\omega}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\prec\\ \\subseteq T\\times T,\\qquad\\operatorname{ch}:T\\to T^{&lt;\\omega}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\prec u\">\\(v\\prec u\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的直接子节点，即 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 是其父节点。对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in T\">\\(u\\in T\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n_u=|\\operatorname{ch}(u)|\">\\(n_u=|\\operatorname{ch}(u)|\\)</span>，则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ch}(u))=\\{v\\in T:v\\prec u\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ch}(u))=\\{v\\in T:v\\prec u\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall i,j&lt;n_u\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{ch}(u)(i)=\\operatorname{ch}(u)(j)\\Longrightarrow i=j\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall i,j&lt;n_u\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{ch}(u)(i)=\\operatorname{ch}(u)(j)\\Longrightarrow i=j\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证明树是五元组 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\">\\((T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\">\\((T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\)</span> 是上述树，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}\">\\(\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}\\)</span>，并且每个节点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in T\">\\(u\\in T\\)</span> 满足下列条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 没有直接子节点且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}\">\\(\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ch}(u)=(u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1})\">\\(\\operatorname{ch}(u)=(u_0,\\ldots,u_{n-1})\\)</span>，并且</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl((\\ell(u_0),\\ldots,\\ell(u_{n-1})),\\ell(u)\\bigr)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl((\\ell(u_0),\\ldots,\\ell(u_{n-1})),\\ell(u)\\bigr)\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-可导性\">7. 可导性</h1>\n<p>对集合参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi,Q\">\\(\\pi,Q\\)</span> 定义证明检查谓词：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}(\\pi,Q)\n\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}\\land\n\\exists T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell\\;\n\\left[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\pi=(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\land\n(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\text{ 满足第 6 节的全部有限有根有序树条件}\\\\\n{}\\land\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}\\land\\ell(r)=Q\\\\\n{}\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;\n\\left((\\operatorname{ch}(u)=()\\land\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}})\n\\lor(\\operatorname{ch}(u)\\ne()\\land(\\ell\\circ\\operatorname{ch}(u),\\ell(u))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}})\\right)\n\\end{array}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}(\\pi,Q)\n\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}\\land\n\\exists T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell\\;\n\\left[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\pi=(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\land\n(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\text{ 满足第 6 节的全部有限有根有序树条件}\\\\\n{}\\land\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}\\land\\ell(r)=Q\\\\\n{}\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;\n\\left((\\operatorname{ch}(u)=()\\land\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}})\n\\lor(\\operatorname{ch}(u)\\ne()\\land(\\ell\\circ\\operatorname{ch}(u),\\ell(u))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}})\\right)\n\\end{array}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\circ\\operatorname{ch}(u)\">\\(\\ell\\circ\\operatorname{ch}(u)\\)</span> 为有序子标号列。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{CycCtx}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{CycCtx}\\)</span> 定义证明纤维类：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}(C)=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}(\\pi,\\vdash C)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}(C)=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}(\\pi,\\vdash C)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本节及下节的证明纤维按参数展开为可定义类，成员断言缩写右侧谓词；不声明所有任意节点重标号的全体为集合，不对该类取幂集。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}C\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}(\\pi,\\vdash C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}C\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}(\\pi,\\vdash C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义可导相继式集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}\n=\n\\{\\vdash C\\in\\mathsf{Seq}:\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}C\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}\n=\n\\{\\vdash C\\in\\mathsf{Seq}:\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}C\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}\">\\(Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathsf{CycCtx}\">\\(C\\in\\mathsf{CycCtx}\\)</span> 定义证明类与证书类：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}(Q)=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}(\\pi,Q)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}(Q)=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}(\\pi,Q)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}(C)=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}(\\pi,\\vdash C)\\}\n=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}(C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}(C)=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}(\\pi,\\vdash C)\\}\n=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}(C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这些类只索引当地有限证明树，不引入语义载体或外延满足关系。</p>\n<p>Cyclic Linear Logic 的目标差异对象：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{CycCtx},\n\\sim_{\\mathsf{rot}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{rot}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\mathsf{CycCtx},\n\\sim_{\\mathsf{rot}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{rot}},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>以下是元层规格包；证明纤维按本地谓词模式展开，不是将真类作为集合元素的元组。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Lit},\\mathsf{Frm},(-)^\\perp,\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}},\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{CycLL}},\\mathsf{List},\\sim_{\\mathsf{rot}},\\mathsf{CycCtx},\\oplus,\\mathsf{Seq},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{rot}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CycLL}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Lit},\\mathsf{Frm},(-)^\\perp,\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}},\\operatorname{Sub}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{CycLL}},\\mathsf{List},\\sim_{\\mathsf{rot}},\\mathsf{CycCtx},\\oplus,\\mathsf{Seq},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{rot}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{CycLL}},\\mathsf{Thm}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{CycLL}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义循环上下文上的线性句法证明关系；不含交换结构、相位语义或证明网。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"869-Cyclic-Linear-Logic","text":"869 Cyclic Linear Logic","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式与结构操作","text":"2. 公式与结构操作","level":1},{"id":"3.-循环上下文","text":"3. 循环上下文","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理","text":"4. 公理","level":1},{"id":"5.-规则关系","text":"5. 规则关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明树","text":"6. 证明树","level":1},{"id":"7.-可导性","text":"7. 可导性","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}^{\\perp}=\\{p^\\perp:p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Lit}=\\mathsf{At}\\cup\\mathsf{At}^{\\perp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\partial(p)=p^\\perp,\\partial(p^\\perp)=p","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot},\\operatorname{ten},\\operatorname{par}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{Lit}\\to\\mathsf{Frm},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{one},\\operatorname{bot}\\in\\mathsf{Frm},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ten},\\operatorname{par}:\\mathsf{Frm}\\